---@class posthog.push_token_imports.CreatePushTokenImportRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field integration_id number The APNs or Firebase push channel to add the devices to.
---@field device_token_file string A UTF-8 CSV file of up to 20 MB. The first line names the columns: `distinct_id` (the ID your app passes to identify) and `device_token` (the APNs device token or FCM registration token). Other columns are ignored.
---@field create_missing_persons? boolean Create a person for a distinct ID that has none. Off by default, so devices of unknown people are listed as failed and can be imported later with new persons.

